# I16 pops: RTXDI's 16x16 screen tiles share one RIS tile per frame (i16_input_structure: 16 px blocks of the DLSS
# input vary as much as single pixels, with or without reuse). Per-pixel tiles against the shipped base
base    di=shipped gi=shipped frame=shipped
seeds   2
cases   cafe.tables cafe.dining sponza.courtyard bistro.street
views   Lit "DLSS input"
kinds   stability
sets    di=shipped gi=shipped frame=shipped di.perPixelLightTiles=on
sets    di=shipped gi=shipped frame=shipped di.perPixelLightTiles=on di.sampling=regir
